      ":question/problem": "Calculate $X-(Y-Z)$, where\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,Y=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,Z=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -4 \\\\ -8 & -8\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n| $X-(Y-Z)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |",
